{
  "uid": "greenroom-overview",
  "title": "Greenroom \u2014 Overview",
  "description": "Panels are ordered by what actually goes wrong. The first row is the four things docs/EVALUATION_METRICS.md listed as 'not yet measurable' \u2014 evaluation failures, LLM fallback rate, sandbox backend split, and guardrail trigger rate. Provisioned from infra/observability/grafana/dashboards/greenroom.json.",
  "tags": [
    "greenroom"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Silent failures \u2014 invisible to the candidate, ruinous to the session",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Evaluations returning the placeholder report",
      "description": "Both LLM providers failed and the candidate got 'Could not generate a detailed report' after finishing a whole interview. The single worst outcome in the app.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(greenroom_evaluations_total{path=\"defaulted\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(greenroom_evaluations_total[$__range])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "defaulted"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.02
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM provider split (Groq \u2192 Ollama fallback rate)",
      "description": "EVALUATION_METRICS.md \u00a77: 'not currently logged as a countable event'. Sustained fallback means Groq's daily quota is gone or it's 5xxing.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider) (rate(greenroom_llm_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sandbox backend split (Judge0 \u2192 RapidAPI \u2192 local)",
      "description": "EVALUATION_METRICS.md \u00a77: 'logged per-request but not aggregated anywhere queryable'. Three tiers: judge0_public \u2192 judge0_rapidapi \u2192 subprocess. The last one runs candidate code inside the backend container with no sandbox isolation \u2014 it is a bridge during an outage, not a steady state, so any sustained share of it is worth acting on.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (backend) (rate(greenroom_sandbox_runs_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Guardrail triggers by layer",
      "description": "EVALUATION_METRICS.md \u00a76: 'needs a logged trigger event, which doesn't exist yet'. Per-layer, because the regex and the LLM judge catching different things is the whole argument for having both. 'safe_fallback' is the alarming one \u2014 the model leaked AND failed to correct itself, so the candidate got a canned question.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (layer) (rate(greenroom_guardrail_checks_total{result=\"triggered\"}[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{layer}} triggered"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Evaluation path",
      "description": "single_pass = transcript fit in one call. chunked = it was too large and went map-reduce. defaulted = both providers failed.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (path) (increase(greenroom_evaluations_total[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{path}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic and latency",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request latency P50 / P95 by route",
      "description": "EVALUATION_METRICS.md \u00a77: latency was logged to stdout only, with nothing aggregating it. Buckets go to 60s because an evaluation can legitimately take 20s+.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(greenroom_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 {{route}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, route) (rate(greenroom_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50 {{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(greenroom_http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cost and cache",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens by call site",
      "description": "Provider-reported, not estimated. The per-turn interviewer call is ~61% of session cost \u2014 see docs/MODEL_COST_MATRIX.md.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (call_site) (rate(greenroom_llm_tokens_total[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{call_site}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spend in range",
      "description": "Token counts are exact; the $/token rate is indicative \u2014 see services/token_meter.py PRICING.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(greenroom_llm_cost_usd_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "USD"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM cache hit rate",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(greenroom_llm_cache_lookups_total{result=\"hit\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(greenroom_llm_cache_lookups_total[$__range])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "hit rate"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sessions started by track",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 24
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "greenroom-prom"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (track) (increase(greenroom_sessions_total[30m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
